@* <summary>Seção pública do AdMetricsPro, preservando a composição e as interações da referência.</summary> *@
<section class="relative z-10 w-full py-space-3xl px-gutter-mobile lg:px-gutter">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto p-space-2xl lg:p-space-3xl rounded-3xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-2xl flex flex-col items-center text-center relative overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Fundo de iluminação direcional sutil -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 via-transparent to-secondary/5 pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[780px] flex flex-col items-center">
            <h2 class="font-headline-section text-headline-section text-on-surface font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-space-md leading-tight">
                Pare de juntar relatórios. Comece a enxergar decisões.
            </h2>
            <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-space-xl">
                Saiba quais criativos merecem renovação, como os canais participam das jornadas e se a verba segue o plano. Traga sua operação para o AdMetricsPro.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-space-md w-full sm:w-auto">
                <a class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-space-sm px-space-xl py-space-md rounded-xl font-body-md text-body-md font-semibold text-on-primary bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-container to-secondary-container hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(0,180,199,0.45)] transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="/onboarding">
                    <span>Testar grátis por 14 dias</span>
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">arrow_forward</span>
                </a>
                <a class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center px-space-xl py-space-md rounded-xl font-body-md text-body-md font-medium text-on-surface bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-all" href="/login">
                    Entrar na plataforma
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
